// Jumps in their 2-byte form where they reach (x64.layout, placeCode): forward jumps over and back
// jumps around bodies of 1 to 24 statements, so that their distances cross the reach of a
// rel8 (-128..127) at some size; the loops are padded (loopPad) after the jumps to their tests,
// the checked additions of the f functions jump to the trap stubs after each function (the w
// functions' wrap, so their back jumps alone cross the reach). Generated by a script
// (the expected values are its own simulation of the same code).
// expect: 1 12358 676
// expect: 2 12338 689
// expect: 3 12349 673
// expect: 4 12379 642
// expect: 5 12354 668
// expect: 6 12338 685
// expect: 7 12297 641
// expect: 8 12339 702
// expect: 9 12414 644
// expect: 10 12306 713
// expect: 11 12405 641
// expect: 12 12347 730
